  <summary>Learn to type with ten fingers by fighting enemies</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="fr">Apprendre à taper avec dix doigts en combattant des ennemis</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Type to Fight is an arcade game that teaches touch typing. Enemies keep coming:
      type the right key to strike them before they reach you.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Progressive lessons, from the F and J home keys to the whole keyboard (AZERTY and QWERTY)</li>
      <li>One color per finger: warm colors for the left hand, complementary colors for the right hand</li>
      <li>Rhythm-game display: the next key falls in the center of the screen</li>
      <li>Your mistakes come back more often until you master them</li>
      <li>94% accuracy is needed to unlock the next level</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This game was made with Godot 4.7.
    </p>
  </description>
